 + scrollable on tablets
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Presentation only — no change to the hourly calculation or data.

- Bigger: height 340 → 380, and larger fonts (y-axis 12, x-axis time labels 11,
  per-point value labels 11, date markers 11) so nothing is cramped.

- Dynamic Y-axis: 0,2,4,6,8,10,12 by default, extended in 2s (14,16,18,…) only
  when an hour actually tops 12 — never a tall empty axis for a quiet run.
